ust a little reminder that that  other epic fight is still going on some  beast pirates fetch a cannon to help  make their way through the samurai so  they can escape burning alive and then  we jump back to yamato apu drake and the  number fuga who may or may not be zoro's  dad according to some theories fuga  represents the number two which could be  a nod to ushimaru's dual wielding style  and this number clearly knows and is  close to yamato just as ushimaru was in  the cave flashback and there's more  possible clues but i personally hope  this is not the case fuga definitely  doesn't have the cool vibe you'd want  from zorro's dad and that ushimaru used  to have we'll see let me know if you  lend any credence to this theory back to  the story and apoo drake and fuga are  all chasing yamato yamato even tells  fuga i know it's been a while but i'm in  a hurry so you can tell they are on good  terms here suddenly brooke and robin  joined the party landing on fuga's hair  cp 0 drops 2 chasing them but they get  caught in the flame yokai everyone is  shocked by this jokai and finally yamato  realizes that if it can go through walls  it'll get to the armory very soon and  set off the explosions while the island  is still in mid-air although she didn't  predict this happening in retrospect oda  sent her down to help stop it again  guardian deity ice wolf stops dangerous  flame yokai sounds very fitting  obviously fire tends to melt ice but ice  then becomes water which is super  effective against fire according to  pokemon at least and there's no telling  how yamato's special ice will mesh with  kanjuro's special fire after all her ice  powers did cancel out kaido's flame  breath blast lastly makami the  inspiration for yamato's fruit was a  guardian deity thought to protect humans  from misfortune including fire so yeah  yamato vs fire yokai confirmed that  being said there has to be a reason  marco and iso are coming too either way  hopefully we'll get a song of ice 