rgy so choose  wisely if you haven't make this the  video you subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications so you don't miss future  one piece videos and updates and while  you wait for the next chapter to drop  feel free to check out my huge and  growing playlist that includes videos on  all yonko admiral supernova and much  more link to that one piece playlist is  in the description and until next time  see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you

